        {
          "claim_id": "02-c7",
          "statement": "On The Generalist, a Periodic founder describes roughly $30 million in annual analysis costs at maximum second-lab throughput and compression to below $1 million using smaller models. This remains an attributed account of projected economics, not audited realized savings.",
          "type": "source_claim",
          "evidence": [
